-- ===========================================================================
-- otbi-atd db/69 : AR_INVOICE_LINES -- chunked + service account
--
-- The user-created job could NEVER complete: private saljaaidi catalog path
-- (service account = Path-not-found; personal MFA runs) AND the single-shot
-- query is killed by the web tier at ~570s every time (2 personal attempts,
-- both dead at 9.5 min -- no column map / table ever created). Converted to
-- the chunked logical-SQL extract (generator runner/aril_def.py): 27 chunks
-- partitioning the space (dim accounting-date NULL x class + past guard +
-- 2025-12-31 Revenue migration lump [48,297 rows] alone + Dec remainder x
-- class + Jan-Aug 2026 month x class + merged Sep-Dec 2026 + open >= 2027
-- tail + zero-row class catch-alls), positional #N headers (38 clean data
-- columns; first successful run auto-prepares the table + map), the
-- analysis' Transaction Line Type <> 'TAX' filter in every chunk, parallel 4
-- (heavier per-row than the dists job -- calibrated 4.2-8.4 ms/row),
-- min_rows 250k (probed total = 320,750). requested_by cleared -> service
-- account. NOTE: params_json is ~14KB -- DEPLOY VIA python-oracledb ON A
-- WORKER VM (Linux SQLcl silently swallows ~10KB+ blocks); this file is the
-- canonical record of the change.
-- ===========================================================================
SET DEFINE OFF
SET SQLBLANKLINES ON

